ous Architecture: The master plan of Ayana Gardens combines sleek, contemporary design with picturesque surroundings, offering refined urban living.</li><li>Seamless Urban Connectivity: Strategically positioned for easy access to key Dubai landmarks, business hubs, and transportation links.</li><li>Vibrant Community: Surrounded by Meydan’s dynamic setting, Ayana Gardens creates a peaceful, connected neighborhood perfect for serene living.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1163,"cta":{"id":1919,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Location_03d52ba932.jpg","hash":"Location_03d52ba932","name":"Location"},"style":null,"title":"Where Urban Convenience meets Serene Living","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The location of Ayana Gardens at Meydan Dubai combines tranquility with easy city access. Nestled in a prestigious area, Ayana Gardens by Tuscany Real Estate and Evolutions offers residents proximity to major landmarks, business hubs, and entertainment venues. This prime location ensures quick access to dining, shopping, and transportation links, making daily commuting or city exploration effortless. Ayana Gardens at Meydan Dubai is an ideal choice for those seeking a refined, serene lifestyle with all the conveniences of urban connectivity at their doorstep.</p><ul><li>05 Minutes to Meydan Racecourse</li><li>05 Minutes to The Meydan Hotel</li><li>10 Minutes to Business Bay</li><li>12 Minutes to Downtown Dubai</li><li>20 Minutes to DXB International Airport</li><li>30 Minutes to Palm Jumeirah</li><li>30 Minutes to Dubai Marina</li><li>35 Minutes to Al Maktoum International Airport</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3147,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/